{"id":"technik","lemma":"Technik","pos":"noun","rank":2158,"glosses":["technique","technology"],"ipa":"/ˈtɛçnɪk/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/3b/De-Technik2.ogg/De-Technik2.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"genitive":"Technik","plural":"Techniken"},"formAudio":{"Techniken":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/75/LL-Q188_%28deu%29-Sebastian_Wallroth-Techniken.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Seine Technik war die beste.","en":"His technique was the best.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"good","l":"gut"}]},{"text":"Wir leben im Zeitalter der Technik.","en":"We live in the age of technology.","words":[{"g":"we"},{"g":"a state in which…"},{"g":"in the"},{"g":"age"},{"g":"the"},null]},{"text":"Meine Technik könnte noch verbessert werden.","en":"My technique could be improved.","words":[{"g":"my","l":"mein"},null,{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"können"},{"g":"still / yet"},{"g":"improved"},{"g":"to become"}]},{"text":"Seine Technik war einzigartig und absolut unglaublich.","en":"His technique was unique and absolutely amazing.","words":[{"g":"his","l":"seiner"},null,{"g":"was","l":"sein"},{"g":"uniquely"},{"g":"and"},{"g":"absolutely"},{"g":"unbelievably"}]},{"text":"Er hat keinen Sinn für moderne Technik.","en":"He does not understand modern technology.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"no / not a","l":"kein"},{"g":"sense"},{"g":"for"},{"g":"modern","l":"modern"},null]}]}